HISTORY
-------

1.1  - Xbox 360 pads through xbox360w.class, with their own buttons
     - joysticks and CD32 pads move the player (only the buttons worked)
     - Turkish language
     - colours given as plain values were wrong on the 68k: the menus'
       highlight bar was an opaque yellow that hid its text, the
       cracktro's scroll texts were missing
     - new 64x64 icon with 32 colours
1.0  - first release


